   5:Allocation/cam.c **** /* B [CAM_IN × CAM_OUT] maps motor commands → [Fz, τx, τy, τz].
   6:Allocation/cam.c ****  * Motor order: M1=rear-right(CCW), M2=front-right(CW),
   7:Allocation/cam.c ****  *              M3=rear-left(CW),   M4=front-left(CCW).
   8:Allocation/cam.c ****  *
   9:Allocation/cam.c ****  * Row 0 (Fz):  [k_t,    k_t,    k_t,    k_t  ]
  10:Allocation/cam.c ****  * Row 1 (τx):  [-k_t*l, -k_t*l, +k_t*l, +k_t*l]   l = arm/√2
  11:Allocation/cam.c ****  * Row 2 (τy):  [+k_t*l, -k_t*l, +k_t*l, -k_t*l]
  12:Allocation/cam.c ****  * Row 3 (τz):  [-k_m,   +k_m,   +k_m,   -k_m  ] */
